fixture tech02_respawn_does_not_keep_the_ember
doc tech 2's chasm (1664 u) with no dash-jump of any kind: a ground dash flat past the edge, a carry-frame jump, the air jump, the air dash at its top and the ember thrown at the end of the dash fall short into the spikes. The respawn puts the ember out, so the teleport press after it goes nowhere and Ash never reaches the far ledge (task 3 review 3, H1: the ember used to outlive the respawn, and the teleport back out to it crossed the chasm).
room test/chasm
spawn 409 384
frames 200
input
  0 R dash
  1..8 R
  9..28 R jump
  29..30 R
  31..49 R jump
  50 R dash
  51..57 R
  58 R toss
  59..99 R
  100 R toss
  101..117 R
  118..137 R jump
  138 R jump dash
  139..199 R
end
expect
  # No dash-jump anywhere: no jump or air jump while a dash runs.
  never 0..199 event.jump=1 dash_frame>0
  never 0..199 event.air_jump=1 dash_frame>0
  never 0..199 event.jump=1 state=dash
  at 9 event.jump=1 vx=2560
  at 31 event.air_jump=1
  at 50 event.dash=1
  at 58 event.toss=1
  mark die 59..99 event.hazard=1
  at die ember=0
  never die..199 event.teleport=1
  never 0..199 x>2144u ground=1
end
